WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.112
Let’s walk through Close the loop.

00:00:02.112 --> 00:00:04.787
Use this checkpoint as a pre-handoff audit.

00:00:04.787 --> 00:00:07.775
Re-read the active move, required fields, rationale,

00:00:07.775 --> 00:00:09.900
destination, and lifecycle label;

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:13.450
correct the source record before using the explicit handoff control

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:13.613
.

00:00:13.613 --> 00:00:16.600
On this slide, confirm the active move, completeness

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:19.863
, rationale, destination, and explicit handoff state before

00:00:19.863 --> 00:00:21.038
the deadline.

00:00:21.038 --> 00:00:24.125
In practice, the Scribe owns a trustworthy record,

00:00:24.125 --> 00:00:27.950
not the team’s strategic judgment and not White Cell’s adjudication

00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:28.113
.

00:00:28.610 --> 00:00:31.447
Before you continue, verify these points:

00:00:31.447 --> 00:00:34.035
Verify the destination before handoff.

00:00:34.035 --> 00:00:37.648
Use responses and timeline to resolve ambiguity.

00:00:37.648 --> 00:00:40.510
Collapse Start Here when you need space and reopen it

00:00:40.510 --> 00:00:41.835
at any time.

00:00:41.835 --> 00:00:45.360
Use the highlighted Session reference area as your visual reference

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:47.060
while you complete this check.
